      "claims": [
        {
          "content": "Diverges from Step 1: Instead of selecting a bid amount and clicking 'Place SmartBid' or 'Place Single Bid', the Customer places a bid directly from a listing page by clicking the 'QuickBid' button — available under the item's price and timer in the catalog view and next to the item in the Category Page List View — without first navigating to the product details page.",
